@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
    Layout = "~/Views/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}

<style>
.privacy-wrap {
    max-width: 780px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.5rem 1.5rem 4rem;
}
.privacy-hero {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    padding-bottom: 1.5rem;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
}
.privacy-hero-eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--accent, #005B71);
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
}
.privacy-hero h1 {
    font-size: 2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text-main, #111827);
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
}
.privacy-hero .privacy-date {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--text-muted, #6b7280);
}
.privacy-section {
    margin-bottom: 2.25rem;
}
.privacy-section h2 {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-main, #111827);
    margin: 0 0 0.65rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
}
.privacy-section h2 i {
    color: var(--accent, #005B71);
    font-size: 1rem;
}
.privacy-section p,
.privacy-section li {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--text-muted, #4b5563);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
}
.privacy-section ul {
    padding-left: 1.4rem;
    margin: 0;
}
.privacy-section ul li {
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
}
.privacy-divider {
    border: none;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
    margin: 2rem 0;
}
.privacy-contact-card {
    background: var(--bg-card, #f8fafc);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-color, #e5e7eb);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--accent, #005B71);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.88rem;
    color: var(--text-muted, #4b5563);
    line-height: 1.6;
}
.privacy-contact-card strong {
    color: var(--text-main, #111827);
}
</style>

<div class="privacy-wrap">

    <div class="privacy-hero">
        <p class="privacy-hero-eyebrow"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock-fill me-1"></i> Rentify Platform</p>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="privacy-date">Effective Date: 1 January 2025 &nbsp;·&nbsp; Last Updated: May 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2><i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill"></i> 1. Overview</h2>
        <p>
            Rentify is a property leasing and maintenance management platform serving tenants, property managers,
            and maintenance staff in Bahrain. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and
            protect your personal information when you use the Rentify platform.
        </p>
        <p>
            By using Rentify, you agree to the practices described in this policy. If you do not agree,
            please discontinue use of the platform.
        </p>
    </div>

    <hr class="privacy-divider" />

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2><i class="bi bi-person-lines-fill"></i> 2. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>We collect the following types of personal information:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Identity Information:</strong> Full name, national ID, date of birth, and gender.</li>
            <li><strong>Contact Information:</strong> Email address and phone number.</li>
            <li><strong>Account Credentials:</strong> Username and encrypted password.</li>
            <li><strong>Financial Information:</strong> Salary, employment status, and marital status (used for lease eligibility).</li>
            <li><strong>Lease & Payment Records:</strong> Lease agreements, payment history, and related dates.</li>
            <li><strong>Maintenance Request Data:</strong> Request details, priority, status updates, and associated unit information.</li>
            <li><strong>Usage Data:</strong> Pages visited, actions performed, and timestamps within the platform.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <hr class="privacy-divider" />

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2><i class="bi bi-gear-fill"></i> 3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>Your information is used solely for the operation of the Rentify platform. Specifically:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>To create and manage your account and verify your identity.</li>
            <li>To process and manage lease applications and active leases.</li>
            <li>To record and track rental payments.</li>
            <li>To assign and manage maintenance requests between tenants and staff.</li>
            <li>To send in-platform notifications about the status of your requests and applications.</li>
            <li>To allow property managers to oversee properties, units, and tenants effectively.</li>
            <li>To assess tenant financial eligibility based on salary and employment information.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do <strong>not</strong> sell, rent, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>
    </div>

    <hr class="privacy-divider" />

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2><i class="bi bi-people-fill"></i> 4. Information Sharing</h2>
        <p>Your data may be shared within the platform only as necessary:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Property Managers</strong> can view tenant profiles, lease applications, maintenance requests, and payment records related to their properties.</li>
            <li><strong>Maintenance Staff</strong> can view the details of requests assigned to them, including the unit and submitting tenant's contact information.</li>
            <li><strong>Tenants</strong> can only access their own profile, lease, payments, and requests.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>No personal data is shared with parties outside the Rentify platform without your explicit consent, unless required by Bahraini law.</p>
    </div>

    <hr class="privacy-divider" />

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2><i class="bi bi-shield-fill-check"></i> 5. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
            We take the security of your personal information seriously. The following measures are in place:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>Passwords are stored using industry-standard hashing (ASP.NET Core Identity).</li>
            <li>All passwords must meet strength requirements: minimum 8 characters, including uppercase, lowercase, a number, and a special character.</li>
            <li>Access to data is role-restricted — tenants, managers, and staff can only access what is relevant to their role.</li>
            <li>All forms are protected against cross-site request forgery (CSRF) using anti-forgery tokens.</li>
            <li>Communication within the platform uses real-time secure connections (SignalR over HTTPS).</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <hr class="privacy-divider" />

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2><i class="bi bi-clock-history"></i> 6. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
            We retain your personal data for as long as your account is active or as needed to provide services.
            Lease and payment records are retained for audit and legal compliance purposes even after a lease ends.
            Maintenance request records are kept for operational history.
        </p>
        <p>
            If you wish to request deletion of your account data, please contact the property management office directly.
        </p>
    </div>

    <hr class="privacy-divider" />

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2><i class="bi bi-person-check-fill"></i> 7. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>As a user of the Rentify platform, you have the right to:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Access</strong> the personal information we hold about you via your profile page.</li>
            <li><strong>Update</strong> your contact details, username, and password through your account settings.</li>
            <li><strong>Request correction</strong> of any inaccurate information by contacting the property manager.</li>
            <li><strong>Request deletion</strong> of your account, subject to outstanding lease or payment obligations.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

    <hr class="privacy-divider" />

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2><i class="bi bi-bell-fill"></i> 8. Notifications</h2>
        <p>
            Rentify uses in-platform real-time notifications (via SignalR) to inform you of updates related to
            your lease applications, maintenance requests, and payments. These notifications are delivered only
            within the platform and are not sent to external services such as email or SMS unless separately configured.
        </p>
    </div>

    <hr class="privacy-divider" />

    <div class="privacy-section">
        <h2><i class="bi bi-pencil-square"></i> 9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>
            We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time to reflect changes in the platform or applicable regulations.
            The "Last Updated" date at the top of this page will reflect any revisions.
            Continued use of the platform after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the updated policy.
        </p>
    </div>

    <hr class="privacy-divider" />

    <div class="privacy-contact-card">
        <strong><i class="bi bi-envelope-fill me-1"></i> Contact Us</strong><br />
        If you have any questions or concerns about this Privacy Policy or how your data is handled,
        please reach out to the Rentify management team:<br /><br />
        <i class="bi bi-geo-alt me-1"></i> Manama, Bahrain<br />
        <i class="bi bi-envelope me-1"></i> support@rentify.com<br />
        <i class="bi bi-telephone me-1"></i> +973 1700 0000
    </div>

</div>
